1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:08,220
This trade is 0.02 lots. You can close just part of it.

2
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:11,430
Right-click it and pick Close Position.

3
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:15,660
Change the amount to the part you want to close, here 0.01.

4
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:19,020
You can also drag this slider.

5
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:24,230
Click Ok.

6
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:28,590
0.01 is closed. The other 0.01 stays open.

7
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:32,600
The chart line now shows 0.01 too. Close the rest the same way when you are ready.

